{"seq":1,"slug":"generate-localize-once","title":"生成即本地化（非先写后译）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ai-commerce-content-generation/multilingual-ai-content/generate-localize-once","wordCount":2799,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"生成即本地化-非先写后译\">生成即本地化（非先写后译）</h1><p>&quot;先写一个语言的版本，再翻译成其它语言&quot;这条路径是翻译时代唯一可行的做法，因为那时机器没有生成能力。生成能力成熟之后，这条路径变成了一个可以绕开的中间环节，而且绕开它省下的不只是翻译费用——中间语言本身会<strong>压扁信息</strong>。这一区分在术语上早已成立：本地化（localisation）以翻译为起点，但包含图形、颜色、货币、日期、地址格式与文化指涉的整体适配，翻译只是其中一环（来源：<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Language_localisation）。一个英文源稿在描述促销节奏时用的是&quot;Black\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Language_localisation）。一个英文源稿在描述促销节奏时用的是&quot;Black</a> Friday doorbuster&quot;，翻译到德语市场时这个词只能被搬运或勉强对应，而如果生成时就直接以德国市场为条件，模型可以写出符合当地促销语汇与节庆习惯的表达。这个差别决定了跨境内容生产架构的基本选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>两条路径的成本与质量结构不同，且差异不是常数——它随语种数量、内容类型与市场差异度变化。</p>\n<p><strong>先写后译（translate-after）</strong>：以源语言产出一份高质量内容 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{src}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">sr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，再对每个目标语种 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 执行翻译 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_l(C_{src})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">sr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。总成本约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>l</mi></msub><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{write} + \\sum_l c_{trans}(l)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{trans}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通常显著低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{write}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。质量上，所有语种共享同一个信息集与结构，<strong>跨语种一致性高</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>生成即本地化（generate-in-locale）</strong>：对每个目标语种 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 直接用该语种生成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>attrs</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>locale</mtext><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_l(\\text{attrs}, \\text{locale}_l)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">attrs</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">locale</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。总成本约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>l</mi></msub><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_l c_{gen}(l)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{gen}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与源语言生成成本同量级。质量上每个语种都可以完整适配本地表达，<strong>本地化程度高但跨语种一致性需要额外保障</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Cost</mtext><mtext>after</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>l</mi></munder><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mtext>Cost</mtext><mtext>once</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>l</mi></munder><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Cost}_{\\text{after}} = c_{write} + \\sum_l c_{trans}(l), \\qquad \\text{Cost}_{\\text{once}} = \\sum_l c_{gen}(l)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cost</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">after</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cost</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">once</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{gen} \\approx c_{trans}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7692em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时两条路径成本相近，此时选择的依据就变成质量与风险，而不是价格。这解释了为什么&quot;生成即本地化&quot;并不总是正确答案——它是一个<strong>取决于内容类型</strong>的选择。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[商品属性] --&gt; B{内容类型判定}&#10;    B --&gt;|法规/认证/规格表| C[先写后译: 强一致性优先]&#10;    B --&gt;|存量高质量源稿| D[先写后译: 复用已有资产]&#10;    B --&gt;|营销/描述/场景文案| E[生成即本地化]&#10;    C --&gt; F[源语言权威稿]&#10;    F --&gt; G[翻译 + 术语锁定]&#10;    G --&gt; H[多语种成稿]&#10;    E --&gt; I[按语种分别生成]&#10;    I --&gt; J[跨语种一致性校验]&#10;    J --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; K[分市场质量校验]\">graph TD\n    A[商品属性] --&gt; B{内容类型判定}\n    B --&gt;|法规/认证/规格表| C[先写后译: 强一致性优先]\n    B --&gt;|存量高质量源稿| D[先写后译: 复用已有资产]\n    B --&gt;|营销/描述/场景文案| E[生成即本地化]\n    C --&gt; F[源语言权威稿]\n    F --&gt; G[翻译 + 术语锁定]\n    G --&gt; H[多语种成稿]\n    E --&gt; I[按语种分别生成]\n    I --&gt; J[跨语种一致性校验]\n    J --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; K[分市场质量校验]</pre><h2 id=\"什么时候先写后译仍然更优\">什么时候先写后译仍然更优</h2><p>三种情形下翻译路径明确优于直接生成，忽略它们会导致真实的合规或品牌风险。</p>\n<p><strong>法规与认证文案。</strong> 认证编号、法规免责声明、安全警示、成分表这类文本的正确性不取决于表达是否地道，而取决于<strong>逐字一致</strong>。同一个 CE 声明在二十个语种下的表述必须严格对齐，任何&quot;更本地化&quot;的改写都可能改变法律含义。这类内容的正确做法是：由法务确认一个权威源稿（通常是英文），再走受控翻译并加术语锁定。翻译路径在这里的价值恰恰是它的一致性，而不是它的成本。</p>\n<p><strong>已有高质量源稿的存量内容。</strong> 如果某个 SKU 的英文详情页是品牌方亲自撰写并被验证有高转化，把它翻译到其它市场是最稳的（保留了已被验证的信息结构）。重新生成会得到一个&quot;看起来也不错但未经验证&quot;的版本，用未验证替换已验证是不理性的。</p>\n<p><strong>强品牌调性的旗舰内容。</strong> 品牌 slogan、核心价值主张、旗舰商品的品牌故事这类内容承载的是不可拆解的品牌资产。它们的多语言版本通常需要人参与打磨，此时源稿 + 译者是更合适的路径。</p>\n<p>反过来，<strong>生成即本地化明显更优</strong>的场景也很清楚：商品标题与五点卖点、场景化描述、本地促销用语、达人/社媒风格文案、以及需要贴合本地搜索习惯的关键词选择。这类内容的共同点是<strong>表达本身就是价值的一部分</strong>，且本地化程度直接影响效果。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>内容类型</th>\n<th>推荐路径</th>\n<th>主要理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>法规/认证/免责声明</td>\n<td>先写后译</td>\n<td>逐字一致性与法务可控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规格表</td>\n<td>先写后译</td>\n<td>结构化数据直接映射，无需生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品牌 slogan / 价值主张</td>\n<td>先写后译 + 人工</td>\n<td>品牌资产不可重造</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已验证高转化的存量详情</td>\n<td>先写后译</td>\n<td>保留已验证的信息结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标题 / 五点卖点</td>\n<td>生成即本地化</td>\n<td>关键词与表达需本地化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>场景化描述 / 营销文案</td>\n<td>生成即本地化</td>\n<td>语感与本地语境是价值主体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社媒 / 达人风格内容</td>\n<td>生成即本地化</td>\n<td>本地流行语与调性无法翻译</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多语言生成的提示词结构\">多语言生成的提示词结构</h2><p>选定了生成路径之后，提示词语句本身要重新设计——把&quot;英文提示词 + 目标语种指令&quot;这种偷懒结构改成<strong>目标语言主导的提示词</strong>。</p>\n<p>一个可行的四段结构（与 <a href=\"../prompt-pipeline/product-attribute-prompt\">2.1 商品属性注入与提示词模板</a> 的分层模板兼容，只是层内语言不同）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>系统指令用目标语言写。</strong> 让模型&quot;用德语写作&quot;与&quot;把以下英文内容改成德语&quot;是两个任务；前者让模型直接以德语为思考语言，产出的语感明显更地道。实践中最简单的改进就是把系统指令翻译成目标语言。</li>\n<li><strong>属性块保持结构化、不翻译键名。</strong> 属性键（<code>material</code>, <code>capacity</code>）保持英文标识符，属性值按需要处理——规格值（&quot;1.5L&quot;）保留原值并在提示中说明转换规则，描述性值（&quot;适合户外露营&quot;）提供目标语种的表述。</li>\n<li><strong>本地化参数显式注入。</strong> 目标市场、目标语种的正式度（德语 Sie/du、法语 vous/tu、日语 敬語级别）、目标市场的单位制、节庆日历。这些参数在第 3.2 篇中被称为&quot;本地可调&quot;的品牌参数。</li>\n<li><strong>格式约束沿用同一份 schema。</strong> 字段结构与 <a href=\"../generation-scenarios/title-bullet-generation\">1.1 标题/卖点/详情自动生成</a> 定义的完全一致，只是长度上限需要按语种重新标定。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>长度约束的按语种标定是必须的，因为同一信息量在不同语言里的字符数差异很大。以一个相对基准来看，若中文表达某信息的长度为 1，英文约为 1.6–2.0，德文常达 2.0–2.5，而阿拉伯语与西班牙语也普遍长于英文。这意味着<strong>同一个 200 字符的标题字段，在德语里能承载的信息量只有中文的一半左右</strong>。如果按中文的长度分配属性注入量，德语的生成必然超限或丢属性。正确的做法是按语种维护长度预算与属性优先级，让长语种只注入最高优先级的属性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨语种一致性保障\">跨语种一致性保障</h2><p>生成即本地化引入的主要风险是<strong>跨语种漂移</strong>：同一个 SKU 在不同语种下声称了不同的参数、不同的折扣、不同的赠品。这类不一致在国际市场会被用户与监管注意到，且修复成本高（需要回溯每个市场的历史内容）。</p>\n<p>保障手段有三层：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>共享结构化事实</strong>。所有语种的生成都从同一份属性快照出发（<a href=\"../prompt-pipeline/batch-generation-workflow\">2.2 海量 SKU 批量生成编排</a> 的规范化属性），而不是每个语种各自取数。这是架构层的保障，成本最低。</li>\n<li><strong>跨语种事实抽取比对</strong>。用一个语言无关的抽取流程把各语种生成结果中的事实主张抽出为结构化形式（数字、单位、型号、认证），再做跨语种比对——同一 SKU 在不同语种下的抽取结果应当一致。这个抽取机制与 <a href=\"../quality-brand-control/generation-quality-gate\">3.1 生成质量校验与事实一致性</a> 的主张抽取是同一套实现，只是比对的目标从&quot;输入属性&quot;换成了&quot;其它语种的输出&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>术语锁定跨语种生效</strong>。品牌词、型号、专有技术名在所有语种下必须完全一致。术语锁定在翻译路径里是成熟做法（见 <a href=\"../../product-localization-production/\">37_product-localization-production</a> 的术语库机制）；在生成路径里它以&quot;必须逐字包含&quot;的词表形式出现在提示词中，并在校验阶段做字面检查。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"成本与质量的实际权衡\">成本与质量的实际权衡</h2><p>把两条路径放在一起做决策时，容易犯的错误是只算模型调用账单。完整口径应当包含：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>生成/翻译调用成本</strong>（两条路径都有）。</li>\n<li><strong>一致性校验成本</strong>（生成路径更高，因为它需要跨语种比对）。</li>\n<li><strong>人审成本</strong>：翻译路径的人审对象是译文，生成路径的人审对象是目标语言原生内容——后者审起来往往更慢，因为审核员需要判断的是&quot;这段本地表达是否得体&quot;，比&quot;译文是否准确&quot;更依赖本地语言能力。</li>\n<li><strong>返工成本</strong>：文化不适配导致的事故（见 <a href=\"cultural-ai-adaptation\">4.2 AI 文化适配与禁忌规避</a>）在两条路径下都存在，但生成路径把它前移到了生成时，修复更便宜。</li>\n<li><strong>时延</strong>：生成路径是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与语种数无关的并行（所有语种同时生成）；翻译路径必须先有源稿，是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的两阶段，对上新速度有影响。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个常被采用的务实架构是<strong>混合路径</strong>：法规类与品牌核心走受控翻译，商品描述与营销类走生成即本地化，两者共用同一份属性快照与同一个质量校验框架。这样既保住了法律与品牌风险最高的部分，又拿到了生成路径在规模与速度上的收益。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>生成即本地化省下的不只是翻译费用，还有中间语言对本地表达、单位、节庆、搜索习惯的压扁。</li>\n<li>两条路径的成本结构是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{write} + \\sum c_{trans}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum c_{gen}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；当两者单次成本接近时，选择依据转为内容类型与风险，而非价格。</li>\n<li><strong>先写后译仍然更优</strong>的三种情形：法规与认证文案（逐字一致性）、已有高质量源稿的存量内容、强品牌调性的旗舰内容；商品描述与营销文案则相反。</li>\n<li>多语言生成的提示词应<strong>以目标语言写系统指令</strong>、保持属性键结构化、显式注入本地化参数（正式度、单位制、节庆），并按语种重新标定长度预算——同字段在德语能承载的信息量约为中文的一半。</li>\n<li>跨语种漂移的防线是三层：共享结构化事实快照、跨语种事实抽取比对、术语字面锁定。</li>\n<li>决策要算<strong>全口径成本</strong>（校验、人审、返工、时延），而非仅模型账单；混合路径通常是务实解。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>语言选定之后，下一个问题是内容在特定市场是否得体——见 <a href=\"cultural-ai-adaptation\">4.2 AI 文化适配与禁忌规避</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生成即本地化（非先写后译）","id":"生成即本地化-非先写后译"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"什么时候先写后译仍然更优","id":"什么时候先写后译仍然更优"},{"level":2,"text":"多语言生成的提示词结构","id":"多语言生成的提示词结构"},{"level":2,"text":"跨语种一致性保障","id":"跨语种一致性保障"},{"level":2,"text":"成本与质量的实际权衡","id":"成本与质量的实际权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"人审/抽检与一键重写","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ai-commerce-content-generation/quality-brand-control/human-in-loop-approve"},"next":{"title":"AI 文化适配与禁忌规避","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ai-commerce-content-generation/multilingual-ai-content/cultural-ai-adaptation"}}